<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuela's Sivensa 1st half net drops.</title>
<headline>Venezuela's Sivensa 1st half net drops.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>1st half 1997	 1st half 1996</p>
<p>    Net profit		$10.62 million	   $38.50 million</p>
<p>    Net sales		$332.14 million	  $319.12 million</p>
<p>    Cost of sales	  $265.35 million	  $266.48 million</p>
<p>    Administrative costs  $34.70 million	   $36.88 million</p>
<p>NOTE: Results to period ending March 31 are consolidated.</p>
<p>Siderurgica Venezolana Sivensa S.A.C.A. is Venezuela's leading steel company.</p>
<p>((-- Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600))</p>
